DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
25712::$$$message_0187_0000_0000$$$::I can't even groan.[lr]::
25713::$$$message_0187_0000_0001$$$::There's a rotten branch piercing my throat.[lr]::
25714::$$$message_0187_0000_0002$$$::My tongue was pulled out at the root.[lr]::
25715::$$$message_0187_0000_0003$$$::They carefully destroyed my vocal cords so that I couldn't form any words.::
25716::$$$message_0187_0001_0000$$$::I don't even have the liberty of writhing in pain.[lr]::
25717::$$$message_0187_0001_0001$$$::I've been dismembered from my hips and shoulders.[lr]::
25718::$$$message_0187_0001_0002$$$::The only living, human part of me left is my heart.[lr]::
25719::$$$message_0187_0001_0003$$$::My body stopped functioning long ago, but my sense of pain still works just fine.[lr]::
25720::$$$message_0187_0001_0004$$$::Living is suffering.[lr]::
25721::$$$message_0187_0001_0005$$$::Even if only my heart is left, I still feel the pain of existence.::
25722::$$$message_0187_0002_0000$$$::It's been a long time.[lr]::
25723::$$$message_0187_0002_0001$$$::They leave me exposed to the elements.::
25724::$$$message_0187_0003_0000$$$::It's extreme hope, and dead-end despair.[lr]::
25725::$$$message_0187_0003_0001$$$::Ridiculous. This is a despicable hallucination.[lr]::
25726::$$$message_0187_0003_0002$$$::It's all a misunderstanding born from an utter lack of perceptiveness and experience.::
25727::$$$message_0187_0004_0000$$$::...I repeat the pain and comfort.[lr]::
25728::$$$message_0187_0004_0001$$$::I recall the repetitive drills I apparently undertook in my youth.[lr]::
25729::$$$message_0187_0004_0002$$$::Heavenward. Hellward. Westward. Eastward.::
25730::$$$message_0187_0005_0000$$$::My lack of limbs and my gradual deterioration don't hurt.[lr]::
25731::$$$message_0187_0005_0001$$$::But I'm afraid.[lr]::
25732::$$$message_0187_0005_0002$$$::I'm afraid of being nothing.[lr]::
25733::$$$message_0187_0005_0003$$$::I can't stand the falsehood of being unable to become anything.[lr]::
25734::$$$message_0187_0005_0004$$$::If I won't be able to produce anything one day...[lr]::
25735::$$$message_0187_0005_0005$$$::...then this must be suffering for the sake of suffering.::
25736::$$$message_0187_0006_0000$$$::A half-dead body on the verge of death.[lr]::
25737::$$$message_0187_0006_0001$$$::I desperately wish to keep living while recklessly wishing for death.[lr]::
25738::$$$message_0187_0006_0002$$$::Long ago, [lr]::
25739::$$$message_0187_0006_0003$$$::they called this contradiction "hell."::
25740::$$$message_0187_0007_0000$$$::If I must confess...[lr]::
25741::$$$message_0187_0007_0001$$$::I never actually wanted to die.[rf]::
25742::$$$message_0187_0008_0000$$$::...I hear a noise.[lr]::
25743::$$$message_0187_0008_0001$$$::Click, click. [se volume=30 storage=se600.wav]Click, click.[lr]::
25744::$$$message_0187_0008_0002$$$::It sounds like pebbles bouncing in a somehow rhythmic way. It reminds me of an upbeat polka song.[lr]::
25745::$$$message_0187_0008_0003$$$::I absently listen to the sound.::
25746::$$$message_0187_0009_0000$$$::...Where am I?[lr]::
25747::$$$message_0187_0009_0001$$$::I can't remember. No, I just don't want to remember.[lr]::
25748::$$$message_0187_0009_0002$$$::I'm ashamed of how ungainly I am.[lr]::
25749::$$$message_0187_0009_0003$$$::I'm awake, but I don't even try to rouse my consciousness or my intellect.::
25750::$$$message_0187_0010_0000$$$::"Ngh, ah..."[lr]::
25751::$$$message_0187_0010_0001$$$::I focus on my heavy head and limbs. I whip my disobedient body into action.[lr]::
25752::$$$message_0187_0010_0002$$$::I force my arms to slightly push up my prone body.[lr]::
25753::$$$message_0187_0010_0003$$$::...I seem to have been lying on a sofa.::
25754::$$$message_0187_0011_0000$$$::I wonder how long I've been asleep.[lr]::
25755::$$$message_0187_0011_0001$$$::[se volume=40 storage=se600.wav]When I try to remember, no, when I try to remember where I am to begin with...[move textoff=0 time=100 path=(0,0,255)(0,0,100)(0,0,0) storage=white accel=0][haze textoff=0 layer=base intime=200 waves=(2,1,5) upper=0 lower=600 center=300 upperpow=0.1 lowerpow=0.1 centerpow=0.6][lr]::
25756::$$$message_0187_0011_0002$$$::A terrible pain courses through my temples.[lr]::
25757::$$$message_0187_0011_0003$$$::I feel dizzy, like a hangover after a night of heavy drinking.[lr]::
25758::$$$message_0187_0011_0004$$$::I have a bad habit of showing off and drinking the night away even though I'm a lightweight, but fortunately, there's no alcohol left in my body.[wm canskip=0]::
25759::$$$message_0187_0012_0000$$$::"This place..."[lr]::
25760::$$$message_0187_0012_0001$$$::My foggy, shaky mind assesses the situation.[lr]::
25761::$$$message_0187_0012_0002$$$::...Is this a mansion?[lr]::
25762::$$$message_0187_0012_0003$$$::[se volume=50 storage=se600.wav]It doesn't look very familiar. I can't quite remember what I was doing here or why I was asleep.::
25763::$$$message_0187_0013_0000$$$::Click. Click. Click.[lr]::
25764::$$$message_0187_0013_0001$$$::The noise continues.[lr]::
25765::$$$message_0187_0013_0002$$$::There's no clock in the room. It's dark outside. My internal sense of time tells me it's after midnight. The room is... It's no use, I can't see very well.[lr]::
25766::$$$message_0187_0013_0003$$$::Not only are my limbs sluggish, my vision is impaired.[lr]::
25767::$$$message_0187_0013_0004$$$::I try to inspect the room, but my vision keeps fluctuating, so I can't get a full picture of it.::
25768::$$$message_0187_0014_0000$$$::I still try to understand what's happening, and finally...[lr]::
25769::$$$message_0187_0014_0001$$$::"Huh...?"[lr]::
25770::$$$message_0187_0014_0002$$$::In front of me,[lr]::
25771::$$$message_0187_0014_0003$$$::I notice someone sitting with their back to me.::
25772::$$$message_0187_0015_0000$$$::"A man...?"[lr]::
25773::$$$message_0187_0015_0001$$$::With the lack of illumination and my poor vision, I can't tell for sure.[lr]::
25774::$$$message_0187_0015_0002$$$::I manage to make out a male silhouette.[lr]::
25775::$$$message_0187_0015_0003$$$::The man is sitting there with his head downcast.[lr]::
25776::$$$message_0187_0015_0004$$$::He's sitting like he's absorbed in a book, and he doesn't notice me.[lr]::
25777::$$$message_0187_0015_0005$$$::He seems to be puzzling over something.::
25778::$$$message_0187_0016_0000$$$::"...?"[lr]::
25779::$$$message_0187_0016_0001$$$::I wonder what he's doing. Slowly, I push myself vertical enough to see his hands.[lr]::
25780::$$$message_0187_0016_0002$$$::My limbs recover more easily than my mind and vision.[lr]::
25781::$$$message_0187_0016_0003$$$::Once I move them, further movement feels easier.::
25782::$$$message_0187_0017_0000$$$::The man isn't looking at a book.[lr]::
25783::$$$message_0187_0017_0001$$$::He's looking at...some kind of sliding puzzle.[lr]::
25784::$$$message_0187_0017_0002$$$::It's a simple game, a picture split into 16 pieces that you shuffle and try to fit back together...I think.[lr]::
25785::$$$message_0187_0017_0003$$$::A form of amusement for children. Something any given person has probably tried once or twice.::
25786::$$$message_0187_0018_0000$$$::The man is absorbed in the puzzle.[lr]::
25787::$$$message_0187_0018_0001$$$::I stop watching him and rise to a sitting position.[lr]::
25788::$$$message_0187_0018_0002$$$::"Hey. You're awake, Master."[lr]::
25789::$$$message_0187_0018_0003$$$::He greets me like an old friend.::
25790::$$$message_0187_0019_0000$$$::"Mas...ter...[noise opacity=90]?"[lr]::
25791::$$$message_0187_0019_0001$$$::I startle [stopnoise]at my own voice.::
25792::$$$message_0187_0020_0000$$$::"Hm? What, you still asleep?[lr]::
25793::$$$message_0187_0020_0001$$$::Come on, wake up already. Your eyes look dead. Where's that super-serious edge?"[lr]::
25794::$$$message_0187_0020_0002$$$::The man snickers.[lr]::
25795::$$$message_0187_0020_0003$$$::His annoying laugh doesn't upset me.[lr]::
25796::$$$message_0187_0020_0004$$$::I just look at him, bemused.::
25797::$$$message_0187_0021_0000$$$::"Why am I..."[lr]::
25798::$$$message_0187_0021_0001$$$::I should prioritize this question first.[lr]::
25799::$$$message_0187_0021_0002$$$::I just can't remember why I was asleep.[lr]::
25800::$$$message_0187_0021_0003$$$::The man frowns[line len=2]somehow I can tell, even though I can't really see him[line len=2]and points to the corner of the room.[lr]::
25801::$$$message_0187_0021_0004$$$::There's an old, cloudy image of someone there.::
25802::$$$message_0187_0022_0000$$$::"See for yourself.[lr]::
25803::$$$message_0187_0022_0001$$$::You can do everything yourself."[lr]::
25804::$$$message_0187_0022_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
25805::$$$message_0187_0022_0003$$$::I move over to the figure with unsteady steps.[lr]::
25806::$$$message_0187_0022_0004$$$::The pale moonlight stands out in the unlit room.[lr]::
25807::$$$message_0187_0022_0005$$$::I see a dirty mirror that looks like it's been abandoned for decades in this house, wherever it is.::
25808::$$$message_0187_0023_0000$$$::And in it...[lr]::
25809::$$$message_0187_0023_0001$$$::I see a figure that's unmistakably me, staring back in amazement.::
25810::$$$message_0187_0024_0000$$$::"Ah..."[lr]::
25811::$$$message_0187_0024_0001$$$::My voice croaks.[lr]::
25812::$$$message_0187_0024_0002$$$::It's incomprehensible. Why am I so surprised to see the image of myself that I've known for over twenty years?[lr]::
25813::$$$message_0187_0024_0003$$$::Dark red hair and eyes.[lr]::
25814::$$$message_0187_0024_0004$$$::A charmless physique that's only good for overpowering other people.[lr]::
25815::$$$message_0187_0024_0005$$$::A men's suit, worn like armor, as if to deny being female.[lr]::
25816::$$$message_0187_0024_0006$$$::This is the person I've always been. Bazett Fraga McRemitz, and no one else.::
25817::$$$message_0187_0025_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
25818::$$$message_0187_0025_0001$$$::And yet, I'm surprised to see myself.[lr]::
25819::$$$message_0187_0025_0002$$$::Something feels wrong about my reflection.[lr]::
25820::$$$message_0187_0025_0003$$$::Something is there which shouldn't be there, and something else is missing.[lr]::
25821::$$$message_0187_0025_0004$$$::Somewhere in the back of my mind, I know it's a contradiction.::
25822::$$$message_0187_0026_0000$$$::"Feeling better yet? Then let's go and kill something.[lr]::
25823::$$$message_0187_0026_0001$$$::Neither of us like getting our asses kicked, do we, [font italic=true]Master?[font italic=false]"::
25824::$$$message_0187_0027_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
25825::$$$message_0187_0027_0001$$$::His words erase a faint wrongness I was feeling.[lr]::
25826::$$$message_0187_0027_0002$$$::   Master.[lr]::
25827::$$$message_0187_0027_0003$$$::Why did I forget that word?[lr]::
25828::$$$message_0187_0027_0004$$$::Seven mages who fight a miraculous war of survival, bearers of the Holy Grail commanding the ultimate familiars.[lr]::
25829::$$$message_0187_0027_0005$$$::I came here to be a Master.[lr]::
25830::$$$message_0187_0027_0006$$$::I came to this island in the Far East to take part in a ritual called the Holy Grail War.::
25831::$$$message_0187_0028_0000$$$::The Holy Grail is a sacred relic said to grant its owner's wish, but no one has ever obtained the true Holy Grail.[lr]::
25832::$$$message_0187_0028_0001$$$::It's only a legend. The Holy Grail summoned in Fuyuki City is a counterfeit of that legend.[lr]::
25833::$$$message_0187_0028_0002$$$::Still, they call it a Holy Grail because it grants wishes, even if it isn't the original.::
25834::$$$message_0187_0029_0000$$$::As far as mages are concerned, its authenticity is of secondary importance.[lr]::
25835::$$$message_0187_0029_0001$$$::They only care whether this replica has power or not. By those standards, the Fuyuki Holy Grail is worth pursuing.[wm canskip=0]::
25836::$$$message_0187_0030_0000$$$::"The 726th Holy Grail summoned in that land has the potential to become the genuine Holy Grail. Go and remove it from the mortal realm, in the name of the order based on our ideals."[lr]::
25837::$$$message_0187_0030_0001$$$::The Mage's Association I belong to...an independent organization formed to conceal magecraft...made that decision.[wt canskip=0]::
25838::$$$message_0187_0031_0000$$$::The Holy Grail War in this land is a competition between mages.[lr]::
25839::$$$message_0187_0031_0001$$$::The Fuyuki Holy Grail War allows a limited number of participants, and the Association occupies only one of those slots.[lr]::
25840::$$$message_0187_0031_0002$$$::Someone specialized in combat would be selected for the position.[lr]::
25841::$$$message_0187_0031_0003$$$::The most appropriate candidate is a mage known for martial prowess, not academic achievement.[wt canskip=0]::
25842::$$$message_0187_0032_0000$$$::...The conflict in this Far Eastern island was simply a nuisance of a ritual, far removed from the internal power struggles of the Association.[lr]::
25843::$$$message_0187_0032_0001$$$::Failure was not permitted, but there was no glory to be gained from this war.[lr]::
25844::$$$message_0187_0032_0002$$$::They chose me to fight it.[wt canskip=0]::
25845::$$$message_0187_0033_0000$$$::I used a family heirloom as my summoning catalyst.[lr]::
25846::$$$message_0187_0033_0001$$$::Armed with the Association's prestige and trust, and a sword, I left the Association for Japan.::
25847::$$$message_0187_0034_0000$$$::"We have nothing to worry about.[lr]::
25848::$$$message_0187_0034_0001$$$::Do we, Bazett Fraga McRemitz?[lr]::
25849::$$$message_0187_0034_0002$$$::You are an exemplary mage. No one can best you in combat. If there was somebody who could, your position would be at stake."::
25850::$$$message_0187_0035_0000$$$::They sent me off with devious smiles.[lr]::
25851::$$$message_0187_0035_0001$$$::As they said, they had the utmost confidence, and utter contempt, for my combat skills.[lr]::
25852::$$$message_0187_0035_0002$$$::A Gods' Holder.[lr]::
25853::$$$message_0187_0035_0003$$$::This title, an ancient magical attribute passed down through my bloodline, defines my existence.[wt canskip=0][current withback=false]::
25854::$$$message_0187_0036_0000$$$::"...That's right. I joined the Holy Grail War as a Master."[lr]::
25855::$$$message_0187_0036_0001$$$::That was my mission: [lr]::
25856::$$$message_0187_0036_0002$$$::to enter the war on behalf of the organization, and win it.[lr]::
25857::$$$message_0187_0036_0003$$$::That was my only mission, I'm sure.::
25858::$$$message_0187_0037_0000$$$::"...Ngh..."[lr]::
25859::$$$message_0187_0037_0001$$$::So...why?[lr]::
25860::$$$message_0187_0037_0002$$$::I have the vague sense that I was searching for something other than the Holy Grail.[lr]::
25861::$$$message_0187_0037_0003$$$::For something. [font italic=true]Someone.[font italic=false][lr]::
25862::$$$message_0187_0037_0004$$$::I must have wanted to meet someone more than I wanted the Holy Grail...::
25863::$$$message_0187_0038_0000$$$::I can't remember.[lr]::
25864::$$$message_0187_0038_0001$$$::What happened over the last few days?[lr]::
25865::$$$message_0187_0038_0002$$$::I know who I am now...but my memories since coming to Fuyuki are a haze.::
25866::$$$message_0187_0039_0000$$$::I remember joining the war as a Master.[lr]::
25867::$$$message_0187_0039_0001$$$::I remember patrolling the town with my Servant.[lr]::
25868::$$$message_0187_0039_0002$$$::But many parts are missing. The last several days... Right, my memories since arriving in town are shrouded in fog.[lr]::
25869::$$$message_0187_0039_0003$$$::In the first place, why was I asleep in this mansion?::
25870::$$$message_0187_0040_0000$$$::"Heyyy. How long are you gonna space out?[lr]::
25871::$$$message_0187_0040_0001$$$::We don't have much time. Let's go clean this mess up."::
25872::$$$message_0187_0041_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
25873::$$$message_0187_0041_0001$$$::...The shadow's been speaking to me for a while.[lr]::
25874::$$$message_0187_0041_0002$$$::He's a Servant. A hero from the past summoned and given form in order to serve me.[lr]::
25875::$$$message_0187_0041_0003$$$::A Heroic Spirit who serves humans, making him the highest order of familiars.::
25876::$$$message_0187_0042_0000$$$::There's a path between Master and Servant, a connection over which magical energy flows.[lr]::
25877::$$$message_0187_0042_0001$$$::My magical energy...simply put, my life force...allows my Servant to act. My body serves as its physical anchor, and I can feel it keeping him in the mortal realm.[lr]::
25878::$$$message_0187_0042_0002$$$::He's my Servant, no doubt about it.[lr]::
25879::$$$message_0187_0042_0003$$$::But...is he really the Servant I summoned...?::
25880::$$$message_0187_0043_0000$$$::"Are you...my Servant?"[lr]::
25881::$$$message_0187_0043_0001$$$::I ask him a question, my head pounding.[lr]::
25882::$$$message_0187_0043_0002$$$::"Say what?"[lr]::
25883::$$$message_0187_0043_0003$$$::The Servant stands up and examines me. He must have finally sensed something wrong.::
25884::$$$message_0187_0044_0000$$$::"Huh... You...[lr]::
25885::$$$message_0187_0044_0001$$$::Your head's not back in the game yet, is it?"[lr]::
25886::$$$message_0187_0044_0002$$$::The shadow flickers and sputters, like a flame.[lr]::
25887::$$$message_0187_0044_0003$$$::...My instincts warn me.[lr]::
25888::$$$message_0187_0044_0004$$$::This man is my Servant, but he's no ally.[lr]::
25889::$$$message_0187_0044_0005$$$::He's a beast who will try to kill his master and get free the first chance he gets.::
25890::$$$message_0187_0045_0000$$$::A Master-Servant relationship isn't built on trust. It's nothing more than a transactional relationship.[lr]::
25891::$$$message_0187_0045_0001$$$::The slightest sign of a flaw or vulnerability in that bond could lead to immediate betrayal.::
25892::$$$message_0187_0046_0000$$$::"Hey. I'm worried about my partner, here. Shouldn't you say something?"[lr]::
25893::$$$message_0187_0046_0001$$$::"...Yes. To be honest, my abilities are impaired right now.[lr]::
25894::$$$message_0187_0046_0002$$$::It doesn't pose a physical problem, but I'm having some mental confusion. My memories from yesterday are especially unclear."::
25895::$$$message_0187_0047_0000$$$::There's nothing to be gained by concealing my memory problems.[lr]::
25896::$$$message_0187_0047_0001$$$::I return my Servant's gaze and admit that there's something wrong with me.[lr]::
25897::$$$message_0187_0047_0002$$$::But I'll hide what I can.[lr]::
25898::$$$message_0187_0047_0003$$$::I can't reveal the fact that my vision is impaired, nor that my memories are missing, not just unclear.[lr]::
25899::$$$message_0187_0047_0004$$$::...Those are my current weaknesses. If this Servant realizes them, he'll probably pounce right away.[lr]::
25900::$$$message_0187_0047_0005$$$::The best I can do now is to act as naturally as I can, try to extract intelligence from him, and try to restore my memories.::
25901::$$$message_0187_0048_0000$$$::"Your memories aren't clear? You don't know anything even after talking to me? You don't know what the Holy Grail is, or even who you are?[lr]::
25902::$$$message_0187_0048_0001$$$::Whoa, whoa, gimme a break! That's even worse than teaming up with a total amateur!"::
25903::$$$message_0187_0049_0000$$$::"No, I have a firm idea of who I am.[lr]::
25904::$$$message_0187_0049_0001$$$::I also remember summoning you and joining the Holy Grail War. My memories after that are vague.[lr]::
25905::$$$message_0187_0049_0002$$$::For example, I just can't remember why I was asleep here."::
25906::$$$message_0187_0050_0000$$$::I state the facts, showing no weakness.[lr]::
25907::$$$message_0187_0050_0001$$$::It seems to work. The Servant's air of suspicion recedes.::
25908::$$$message_0187_0051_0000$$$::"Now it is my turn to ask a question: [lr]::
25909::$$$message_0187_0051_0001$$$::can you tell me why I was asleep here?"[lr]::
25910::$$$message_0187_0051_0002$$$::"How am I supposed to know that?[lr]::
25911::$$$message_0187_0051_0003$$$::You said this mansion would be our hideout, and you're the one who said right after you summoned me that you were tired so you wanted to rest.[lr]::
25912::$$$message_0187_0051_0004$$$::Do you remember that much?"::
25913::$$$message_0187_0052_0000$$$::...Hm.[lr]::
25914::$$$message_0187_0052_0001$$$::I do remember looking for a place to make my base of operations before I arrived in Fuyuki.[lr]::
25915::$$$message_0187_0052_0002$$$::This mansion...yes, this place was a potential location.[lr]::
25916::$$$message_0187_0052_0003$$$::...My consciousness dims.[lr]::
25917::$$$message_0187_0052_0004$$$::I feel faint when I try to recall my memories.[lr]::
25918::$$$message_0187_0052_0005$$$::I shouldn't push myself too hard now. ::
25919::$$$message_0187_0053_0000$$$::"I must have made the decision to make this my base. I remember doing that.[lr]::
25920::$$$message_0187_0053_0001$$$::And then...I summoned you."[lr]::
25921::$$$message_0187_0053_0002$$$::I remember it, vaguely.[lr]::
25922::$$$message_0187_0053_0003$$$::I'm sure I made a pact with this Servant, in this mansion.::
25923::$$$message_0187_0054_0000$$$::"Right, right. Then you went straight to sleep. You just told me your name and said not to do anything until you woke up.[lr]::
25924::$$$message_0187_0054_0001$$$::So I've been stuck here, too.[lr]::
25925::$$$message_0187_0054_0002$$$::You summoned me to do some killing, so why do we have to put it all on hold?"::
25926::$$$message_0187_0055_0000$$$::I only told him my name...?[lr]::
25927::$$$message_0187_0055_0001$$$::Wait... More importantly, this Servant's behavior is dangerous.[lr]::
25928::$$$message_0187_0055_0002$$$::He seems belligerent and reliable, but it would be a concern if he enjoyed combat too much.::
25929::$$$message_0187_0056_0000$$$::"Wait. Just to confirm, we never talked about our basic strategy?"::
25930::$$$message_0187_0057_0000$$$::"Nope. We probably didn't need to.[lr]::
25931::$$$message_0187_0057_0001$$$::You already did your research into this town, and they pounded what the Holy Grail War is into my head as soon as I was summoned.[lr]::
25932::$$$message_0187_0057_0002$$$::So we just need to be fast, efficient, and ruthless about killing the other Masters. No need to have a meeting about it."::
25933::$$$message_0187_0058_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
25934::$$$message_0187_0058_0001$$$::"...Ugh, stop making that scary face. Your glare gives me the chills.[lr]::
25935::$$$message_0187_0058_0002$$$::Did I say something to offend you?"[lr]::
25936::$$$message_0187_0058_0003$$$::"Yes. We need to understand each other better. It annoys me that my Servant is so thoughtless.[lr]::
25937::$$$message_0187_0058_0004$$$::I am a mage representing the Association, and I don't intend to be a beast tamer."::
25938::$$$message_0187_0059_0000$$$::I cow my Servant with a glare.[lr]::
25939::$$$message_0187_0059_0001$$$::My Servant muses and looks away.[lr]::
25940::$$$message_0187_0059_0002$$$::"...Well, I don't expect we'll understand much about each other."[lr]::
25941::$$$message_0187_0059_0003$$$::He murmurs as if it doesn't concern him.::
25942::$$$message_0187_0060_0000$$$::"Fine. Well, oh great Association representative, what kind of war do you want to wage?"[lr]::
25943::$$$message_0187_0060_0001$$$::"A covert one, without unnecessary conflict.[lr]::
25944::$$$message_0187_0060_0002$$$::Our first priority is to investigate the enemy Masters. Once we know the particulars of this Holy Grail War, we can consider the order in which to defeat our enemies and begin eliminating them."::
25945::$$$message_0187_0061_0000$$$::Those were my orders from the Association.[lr]::
25946::$$$message_0187_0061_0001$$$::First, I need to investigate the three families administering the war: the Einzbern, Tohsaka, and Makiri Masters.[lr]::
25947::$$$message_0187_0061_0002$$$::Then, I'll look into the other three Masters.[lr]::
25948::$$$message_0187_0061_0003$$$::Dialogue might help me identify mages who are willing to give up being Masters. They might even be worth securing for the Association.[lr]::
25949::$$$message_0187_0061_0004$$$::In any case, I would be embarrassing myself as an Association mage if I took action before I've gathered all of the necessary information.::
25950::$$$message_0187_0062_0000$$$::"Whaaat? What are you taking it so slow for? You're not their dog.[lr]::
25951::$$$message_0187_0062_0001$$$::Just find your enemies and kill them, Master. You're all in the same business of crushing each other. Once you meet, there's no running from that fate, nor will anyone let you run."[lr]::
25952::$$$message_0187_0062_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
25953::$$$message_0187_0062_0003$$$::...He's right, of course.[lr]::
25954::$$$message_0187_0062_0004$$$::I agree with him, but I can't go against the Association's orders.::
25955::$$$message_0187_0063_0000$$$::"Do what I say. The Association exists to conceal Mystics from the public. We can't act rashly.[lr]::
25956::$$$message_0187_0063_0001$$$::A chaotic war would also harm civilians.[lr]::
25957::$$$message_0187_0063_0002$$$::Obtaining the Holy Grail is a non-negotiable, but we should try to avoid involving bystanders as much as possible."::
25958::$$$message_0187_0064_0000$$$::This isn't only about the Mage's Association.[lr]::
25959::$$$message_0187_0064_0001$$$::The Holy Church is also involved in the war.[lr]::
25960::$$$message_0187_0064_0002$$$::When collateral damage occurs, they swiftly suppress the news to allow the ritual to continue undisturbed.[lr]::
25961::$$$message_0187_0064_0003$$$::But excessive damage would earn their hostility.[lr]::
25962::$$$message_0187_0064_0004$$$::During the previous war, meaning the Fourth Holy Grail War, there was a Master who indiscriminately attacked civilians. It's said that the priest serving as the Overseer declared that Master a foreign enemy and heavily penalized them.::
25963::$$$message_0187_0065_0000$$$::"Huh... So we have to be picky about how we fight.[lr]::
25964::$$$message_0187_0065_0001$$$::I don't have any ideas, but you're saying it's better not to kill in order to survive?"[lr]::
25965::$$$message_0187_0065_0002$$$::"This isn't about survival. I'm a mage, too. I'll do whatever's necessary to win.[lr]::
25966::$$$message_0187_0065_0003$$$::Still, we should abide by a minimum of professional standards."::
25967::$$$message_0187_0066_0000$$$::"Huh... That's kinda..."[lr]::
25968::$$$message_0187_0066_0001$$$::He sounds listless.[lr]::
25969::$$$message_0187_0066_0002$$$::The Servant heaves an apathetic sigh.::
25970::$$$message_0187_0067_0000$$$::"...Why don't you use a Command Spell?[lr]::
25971::$$$message_0187_0067_0001$$$::Order me not to disobey you, or something. I might kill you right away, if you don't."::
25972::$$$message_0187_0068_0000$$$::He growls.[lr]::
25973::$$$message_0187_0068_0001$$$::This Servant means it.[lr]::
25974::$$$message_0187_0068_0002$$$::He's not thinking about the aftermath.[lr]::
25975::$$$message_0187_0068_0003$$$::The rule about helping his Master out of self-preservation doesn't apply to him.[lr]::
25976::$$$message_0187_0068_0004$$$::He's really after my head,::
25977::$$$message_0187_0069_0000$$$::and he's telling me to use a Command Spell to prevent that.[lr]::
25978::$$$message_0187_0069_0001$$$::The Holy Grail grants each Master three Command Spells,[lr]::
25979::$$$message_0187_0069_0002$$$::each of which can be used to issue unbreakable orders.[lr]::
25980::$$$message_0187_0069_0003$$$::They're a Master's trump card that can enforce any command, but there are only three of them.[lr]::
25981::$$$message_0187_0069_0004$$$::I answer instantly.::
25982::$$$message_0187_0070_0000$$$::"...I refuse. A pet dog doesn't order its master around, and I wouldn't be a master if I let my pet dog kill me.[lr]::
25983::$$$message_0187_0070_0001$$$::You are my Servant. I choose how you act and when you die."::
25984::$$$message_0187_0071_0000$$$::I return his bloodlust in equal measure.[lr]::
25985::$$$message_0187_0071_0001$$$::At any rate, I won't last long if I waste Command Spells on petty squabbles.[lr]::
25986::$$$message_0187_0071_0002$$$::I ball my right hand into a fist and inscribe a rune into the floor with my heel, ready to intercept his attack at any time.::
25987::$$$message_0187_0072_0000$$$::"I see. Hmm, then I guess I'll change my tune.[lr]::
25988::$$$message_0187_0072_0001$$$::Okay, I'm your Servant. I'll do what my owner says."[lr]::
25989::$$$message_0187_0072_0002$$$::"..."::
25990::$$$message_0187_0073_0000$$$::My Servant folds easily.[lr]::
25991::$$$message_0187_0073_0001$$$::That was...a little anticlimactic.[lr]::
25992::$$$message_0187_0073_0002$$$::I was ready for an all-out fight, thinking it might be a good chance to gauge my Servant's strength.::
25993::$$$message_0187_0074_0000$$$::"Hm? What now, you still complaining?"[lr]::
25994::$$$message_0187_0074_0001$$$::"N-no, I don't have a problem with this.[lr]::
25995::$$$message_0187_0074_0002$$$::...Do you really understand what I'm saying?"[lr]::
25996::$$$message_0187_0074_0003$$$::"Yeah. Try not to get people killed, right?[lr]::
25997::$$$message_0187_0074_0004$$$::I understand that's your overall approach. So? Anything else you want to say?"[lr]::
25998::$$$message_0187_0074_0005$$$::...Plenty, in fact, but not as part of a discussion about strategy. I can just give him orders according to the situation later.::
25999::$$$message_0187_0075_0000$$$::"All right. Then let's go. I'm getting sick of this room."[lr]::
26000::$$$message_0187_0075_0001$$$::My Servant urges me to go into the city.[lr]::
26001::$$$message_0187_0075_0002$$$::My body still feels unstable, but the city weighs on my mind.[lr]::
26002::$$$message_0187_0075_0003$$$::I feel as if my body craves the freedom of exercise, after being asleep for so long.::
26003::$$$message_0187_0076_0000$$$::"...All right. I'll make fine adjustments to our approach as the situation changes."[lr]::
26004::$$$message_0187_0076_0001$$$::I gather myself.[lr]::
26005::$$$message_0187_0076_0002$$$::I'll leave my pack here for now.[lr]::
26006::$$$message_0187_0076_0003$$$::I only have a few uses of the blade, and I can't wield it properly in my current condition.[lr]::
26007::$$$message_0187_0076_0004$$$::Once we identify the other Masters, I'll consider who to use it against.::
26008::$$$message_0187_0077_0000$$$::"Still, though, you want to avoid killing people? Hehehe. That could be a blast."[lr]::
26009::$$$message_0187_0077_0001$$$::The Servant repeats himself cheerfully.::
26010::$$$message_0187_0078_0000$$$::"...I don't like your tone.[lr]::
26011::$$$message_0187_0078_0001$$$::If you have any opinions about our approach, you should voice them now."[lr]::
26012::$$$message_0187_0078_0002$$$::"I told you, I get it. You're scary, so I don't wanna throw down with you yet.[wdash canskip=0][lr]::
26013::$$$message_0187_0078_0003$$$::Still, you're asking the impossible, Master.[lr]::
26014::$$$message_0187_0078_0004$$$::It doesn't have anything to do with collateral damage.[lr]::
26015::$$$message_0187_0078_0005$$$::No matter how hard you try, you won't last more than four days in this city."::
26016::$$$message_0187_0079_0000$$$::...? Four...days?::
26017::$$$message_0187_0080_0000$$$::"What...did you say?"[lr]::
26018::$$$message_0187_0080_0001$$$::"You'll know once you step outside. We're long past that point. The city population is in freefall thanks to the [font italic=true]mysterious bunch[font italic=false] appearing day after day."::
26019::$$$message_0187_0081_0000$$$::"What mysterious bunch?[lr]::
26020::$$$message_0187_0081_0001$$$::You're lying. Trying to mislead me with absurd claims because of my memory[line len=2]"[lr]::
26021::$$$message_0187_0081_0002$$$::"You'll know once you step outside. Seeing is believing."[lr]::
26022::$$$message_0187_0081_0003$$$::The Servant stifles a cackle.[lr]::
26023::$$$message_0187_0081_0004$$$::When I hesitate, the dark shadow takes my hand and starts walking.::
26024::$$$message_0187_0082_0000$$$::"Come on, let's continue the Holy Grail War, Bazett Fraga McRemitz.[lr]::
26025::$$$message_0187_0082_0001$$$::...All so we can find your wish this time."[wvs][wt canskip=0][current withback=false][wait canskip=0 time=500][se storage=se409.wav][se storage=se322.wav]::
26026::$$$message_0187_0083_0000$$$::The mansion is built on a high hill.[lr]::
26027::$$$message_0187_0083_0001$$$::It's nestled, nearly concealed, by a thicket of trees, and there are no other houses around.[lr]::
26028::$$$message_0187_0083_0002$$$::...I have a headache.[lr]::
26029::$$$message_0187_0083_0003$$$::I thought that some fresh air would help clear my head, but the cold night air muddies my thoughts even further.[wm canskip=0]::
26030::$$$message_0187_0084_0000$$$::"What's up, Master? Was it still too early to go outside?"[lr]::
26031::$$$message_0187_0084_0001$$$::My Servant teases me.[lr]::
26032::$$$message_0187_0084_0002$$$::I shake my head and keep going.[lr]::
26033::$$$message_0187_0084_0003$$$::My consciousness slowly spins.[lr]::
26034::$$$message_0187_0084_0004$$$::I feel dizzy under the bright moonlight.[wm canskip=0]::
26035::$$$message_0187_0085_0000$$$::It's quiet.[lr]::
26036::$$$message_0187_0085_0001$$$::Even though it's past 2:00 AM, the city feels too quiet.::
26037::$$$message_0187_0086_0000$$$::...But it might resemble my hometown.[lr]::
26038::$$$message_0187_0086_0001$$$::I grew up in a seaside town.[lr]::
26039::$$$message_0187_0086_0002$$$::At night, sea mist would fill the air, and people would lock themselves up in their homes, perhaps out of fear.[lr]::
26040::$$$message_0187_0086_0003$$$::The empty town felt like a sunken ship in the abyss. When I was a child, I wished I could run away from that place.[lr]::
26041::$$$message_0187_0086_0004$$$::I probably thought that everyone would forget me if I spent too much time at the bottom of the sea.[lr]::
26042::$$$message_0187_0086_0005$$$::I couldn't help but think that being forgotten by everyone was a curse, like the fate of all the ancient gods.::
26043::$$$message_0187_0087_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
26044::$$$message_0187_0087_0001$$$::And now, the city of Fuyuki is sinking into the ocean.[lr]::
26045::$$$message_0187_0087_0002$$$::It feels different from the Fuyuki of my memories.[lr]::
26046::$$$message_0187_0087_0003$$$::Too quiet...just like a ruin.[lr]::
26047::$$$message_0187_0087_0004$$$::Regardless, I can sense life in it.[lr]::
26048::$$$message_0187_0087_0005$$$::I keenly feel the breathing of an immense number of creatures.[lr]::
26049::$$$message_0187_0087_0006$$$::The air around me is filled with presences I've never experienced before.[lr]::
26050::$$$message_0187_0087_0007$$$::...The Servant mentioned a "mysterious bunch." I hate to admit it, but his words seem credible now.::
26051::$$$message_0187_0088_0000$$$::"Oh, what's that?"[lr]::
26052::$$$message_0187_0088_0001$$$::I think we've been walking for about two hours.[lr]::
26053::$$$message_0187_0088_0002$$$::The Servant halts and looks at a house.::
26054::$$$message_0187_0089_0000$$$::"Wow. I already looked around here, but there's still one left."[lr]::
26055::$$$message_0187_0089_0001$$$::He sounds impressed.[lr]::
26056::$$$message_0187_0089_0002$$$::He's looking at an unremarkable house.[lr]::
26057::$$$message_0187_0089_0003$$$::It differs from the other houses in some details, but it's just a house that's still lit.::
26058::$$$message_0187_0090_0000$$$::"You should wait out here. You aren't feeling 100% yet, right?[lr]::
26059::$$$message_0187_0090_0001$$$::I'll go check it out first."[lr]::
26060::$$$message_0187_0090_0002$$$::The Servant starts walking.[lr]::
26061::$$$message_0187_0090_0003$$$::I follow him,[lr]::
26062::$$$message_0187_0090_0004$$$::but the moonlight dazes me. How pathetic.[wm canskip=0]::
26063::$$$message_0187_0091_0000$$$::   To be honest...[lr]::
26064::$$$message_0187_0091_0001$$$::I don't know what the other Servants are like, but I showed up not really wanting to do anything.::
26065::$$$message_0187_0092_0000$$$::Servants are a form of grand magecraft, whereby heroes enshrined in lore are summoned, given humanoid shapes, and made to serve as familiars.[lr]::
26066::$$$message_0187_0092_0001$$$::It isn't the piecemeal borrowing of their power that spirit mediums do, but a rule-breaking feat that projects the entire person onto the real world.[lr]::
26067::$$$message_0187_0092_0002$$$::A resurrection exclusive to the Holy Grail War. Short-lived clones. Guardians of humanity, revived in the current era.[lr]::
26068::$$$message_0187_0092_0003$$$::It sounds great. Autonomous weapons sure are handy.[wm canskip=0]::
26069::$$$message_0187_0093_0000$$$::But it goes overboard and recreates their internal selves, too.[lr]::
26070::$$$message_0187_0093_0001$$$::Familiars don't need intelligence. That goes doubly for Servants. If a familiar that's superior to its master gains knowledge and awareness, it's bound to overthrow its master.[lr]::
26071::$$$message_0187_0093_0002$$$::Luckily, I'm personally satisfied with my Master; she's just the type of woman I like. But I still end up acting defiant.[lr]::
26072::$$$message_0187_0093_0003$$$::Why, you ask?[lr]::
26073::$$$message_0187_0093_0004$$$::You can't blame me. I might not be dissatisfied with my Master, but I'm fed up with the whole world.[lr]::
26074::$$$message_0187_0093_0005$$$::I'm in the worst mood. How would you feel if someone left you in a dumping ground for dead bodies?[wm canskip=0]::
26075::$$$message_0187_0094_0000$$$::While I was alive, the world was still vibrant enough.[lr]::
26076::$$$message_0187_0094_0001$$$::But now, it's a dying old husk beyond saving, with billions living on it. From the perspective of someone who knew it when it was a lively place, I'm obligated to feel a little resentful.[lr]::
26077::$$$message_0187_0094_0002$$$::I mean, I knew it would get consumed eventually, but at this pace?[lr]::
26078::$$$message_0187_0094_0003$$$::The sheer shamelessness of it makes me hate my own kind, but at the same time, I feel its worth praising.::
26079::$$$message_0187_0095_0000$$$::Human power is just too freaking amazing.[lr]::
26080::$$$message_0187_0095_0001$$$::Dizzying changes of moral systems. I wonder how many generations, how many new human species, have been born and wiped out so far.[lr]::
26081::$$$message_0187_0095_0002$$$::They're going about it so fast, it's a little sad to see they haven't come up with an evolutionary theory that doesn't involve draining the Earth dry. Gotta hand it to them, they sure did a bang-up job amplifying a ready-made system instead of inventing a new one.[wt canskip=0]::
26082::$$$message_0187_0096_0000$$$::Anyway, they've got no future, so I'd like to see them use the little time they have left to show some new growth.[lr]::
26083::$$$message_0187_0096_0001$$$::They already destroyed so much, you know.[lr]::
26084::$$$message_0187_0096_0002$$$::Where did we want to go? What did we consume the earth for? In other words, was it good and possible, or evil and impossible? I want to see results that anyone can understand. It doesn't matter if we failed.[wt canskip=0][current withback=false][condoff textoff=0 target=all time=100]::
26085::$$$message_0187_0097_0000$$$::"Aw, man. I wonder what the others think of all this."[lr]::
26086::$$$message_0187_0097_0001$$$::As Heroic Spirits, they must feel some antipathy toward this era.[lr]::
26087::$$$message_0187_0097_0002$$$::Or does being a Heroic Spirit mean supporting humanity despite that, and accepting the outcome, whatever it might be, just like how I reject all outcomes?::
26088::$$$message_0187_0098_0000$$$::Hypothetically, if an absolute, godlike being exists as an embodiment of goodness, what would it do if it were summoned to this era?[lr]::
26089::$$$message_0187_0098_0001$$$::Would it approve of the world, or defend it?[lr]::
26090::$$$message_0187_0098_0002$$$::If it approved, then it would cause destruction. If it wanted to defend the world, then it would just watch.[lr]::
26091::$$$message_0187_0098_0003$$$::A proper Heroic Spirit would probably defend it.[lr]::
26092::$$$message_0187_0098_0004$$$::Someone with a screw loose would gladly lend a hand, while someone with only one screw left in their head might muster the courage to make the world anew.[lr]::
26093::$$$message_0187_0098_0005$$$::Stuff like saving the world and all that.[lr]::
26094::$$$message_0187_0098_0006$$$::Wow, I don't even want to meet someone like that, much less fight them.[wdash canskip=0]::
26095::$$$message_0187_0099_0000$$$::Either way, there's only one thing for me to do.[lr]::
26096::$$$message_0187_0099_0001$$$::I'm supposedly a Heroic Spirit, but I'm not strong at all. I'm the weakest Heroic Spirit there is, even though my legend spans the world.[lr]::
26097::$$$message_0187_0099_0002$$$::Yay! I'm number one! You're in luck, Master, you're winning the race to the bottom! It's pretty easy to come up with a battle plan, you just need to figure out how to eat up all the strong guys.::
26098::$$$message_0187_0100_0000$$$::...I hate to admit it, but in pure fighting strength, she might actually be stronger than me.[lr]::
26099::$$$message_0187_0100_0001$$$::A Heroic Spirit that would lose head-to-head against a human, huh? Hehehe. Wish I could disappear.[wt canskip=0][current withback=false]::
26100::$$$message_0187_0101_0000$$$::"I know, right? I can't believe that chick."[lr]::
26101::$$$message_0187_0101_0001$$$::Bazett said to try to avoid killing anyone.[lr]::
26102::$$$message_0187_0101_0002$$$::That's exactly the kind of sheltered, overachiever attitude I'd expect from an heiress to a noble mage family. What a noble example of humanity, surely worthy to be a Heroic Spirit's Master.::
26103::$$$message_0187_0102_0000$$$::But that's beyond me.[lr]::
26104::$$$message_0187_0102_0001$$$::All I can do is kill, and if I'm being honest, a bloodless victory sounds horribly dull.[lr]::
26105::$$$message_0187_0102_0002$$$::I'm the weakest, so I can't afford to be that scrupulous.[lr]::
26106::$$$message_0187_0102_0003$$$::Even if this is supposedly a war, it still uses a mechanism of slaughter that humans worked really hard to make.[lr]::
26107::$$$message_0187_0102_0004$$$::Servants aside, Masters are only human. It would be simpler to plant landmines or drop bombs like they did in the last war.::
26108::$$$message_0187_0103_0000$$$::"...Times have changed, though.[lr]::
26109::$$$message_0187_0103_0001$$$::Those were turbulent times, and life was cheap..."[lr]::
26110::$$$message_0187_0103_0002$$$::That won't fly this time.[lr]::
26111::$$$message_0187_0103_0003$$$::The Mage's Association is keeping a close watch, and modern humans are great at keeping public order. If we make too much of a mess, it'll give away Bazett's position to the other Masters, too.::
26112::$$$message_0187_0104_0000$$$::It would be great if we could go full speed and settle things as soon as possible, but we should avoid tiring ourselves out with consecutive battles every night.[lr]::
26113::$$$message_0187_0104_0001$$$::On that point, I agree with Bazett's restrained approach.[lr]::
26114::$$$message_0187_0104_0002$$$::I agree, so I'll do my best to obey my Master like a Servant should.::
26115::$$$message_0187_0105_0000$$$::Now...[lr]::
26116::$$$message_0187_0105_0001$$$::Let's get back to the present.::
26117::$$$message_0187_0106_0000$$$::"Wait... What do you think you're doing?"[lr]::
26118::$$$message_0187_0106_0001$$$::I ignore my fainthearted Master's voice and head towards a house.[lr]::
26119::$$$message_0187_0106_0002$$$::No need for investigation. There's obviously people living inside.[lr]::
26120::$$$message_0187_0106_0003$$$::The lights are on.[lr]::
26121::$$$message_0187_0106_0004$$$::Sadly, I don't have the ability to sense humans, nor can I detect heat sources.[lr]::
26122::$$$message_0187_0106_0005$$$::My skills as a Servant are zilch.[lr]::
26123::$$$message_0187_0106_0006$$$::But that's okay. There are [font italic=true]humans[font italic=false] inside.::
26124::$$$message_0187_0107_0000$$$::I turn into spirit form and glide through the front door.[lr]::
26125::$$$message_0187_0107_0001$$$::I materialize my weapons and head for the living room.[lr]::
26126::$$$message_0187_0107_0002$$$::I'll finish it quickly and cruelly, like I always do.[lr]::
26127::$$$message_0187_0107_0003$$$::Even if by some mistake the world's strongest superman is in here, someone who can outfight a Heroic Spirit, that doesn't pose a problem.[lr]::
26128::$$$message_0187_0107_0004$$$::I'm the weakest, but I can beat the strongest human.[lr]::
26129::$$$message_0187_0107_0005$$$::That's why...::
26130::$$$message_0187_0108_0000$$$::                     I don't mean to brag, but…[lr]::
26131::$$$message_0187_0108_0001$$$::                     I'm the strongest in the world if I'm up against a human.::
26132::$$$message_0187_0109_0000$$$::Blood sprays.[lr]::
26133::$$$message_0187_0109_0001$$$::The residents are dead.[lr]::
26134::$$$message_0187_0109_0002$$$::A middle-aged man, two boys, an old woman, and a grandpa holding a bloody knife... The old guy's still alive.[lr]::
26135::$$$message_0187_0109_0003$$$::"What the..."[lr]::
26136::$$$message_0187_0109_0004$$$::What a letdown.[lr]::
26137::$$$message_0187_0109_0005$$$::It was already finished by the time I came in.::
26138::$$$message_0187_0110_0000$$$::He's breathing hard.[lr]::
26139::$$$message_0187_0110_0001$$$::A heinous criminal who murdered four people.[lr]::
26140::$$$message_0187_0110_0002$$$::He seems to want to murder the old guy so badly, he doesn't care that I just came in.[lr]::
26141::$$$message_0187_0110_0003$$$::"Eek, eeek, eeeeek!"[lr]::
26142::$$$message_0187_0110_0004$$$::The old man scrambles back into the wall, desperately shaking his head.[wdash canskip=0]::
26143::$$$message_0187_0111_0000$$$::The scene and method of the murder are gruesome.[lr]::
26144::$$$message_0187_0111_0001$$$::Everyone is torn up beyond recognition, their blood, flesh, and organs spectacularly strewn around the room.[lr]::
26145::$$$message_0187_0111_0002$$$::A happy family all together, with the suffocating stench of life, and a gooey, smeared living space.::
26146::$$$message_0187_0112_0000$$$::Tch. What a clean crime scene.[lr]::
26147::$$$message_0187_0112_0001$$$::And not a stain to be found in his performance. It's killing for the sake of killing.[lr]::
26148::$$$message_0187_0112_0002$$$::There isn't a single trace of plunder, humiliation, or hunger. [wm canskip=0]::
26149::$$$message_0187_0113_0000$$$::"S-someone, help...!"[lr]::
26150::$$$message_0187_0113_0001$$$::I help him, since he asked.[lr]::
26151::$$$message_0187_0113_0002$$$::The murderer is easy to ambush and kill from behind.[lr]::
26152::$$$message_0187_0113_0003$$$::After that, I return to my original job.::
26153::$$$message_0187_0114_0000$$$::By the time I run into the house, everything is already over.::
26154::$$$message_0187_0115_0000$$$::"This is awful..."[lr]::
26155::$$$message_0187_0115_0001$$$::There are five bodies in the living room. I base the number on the five heads recently severed from the nose up.[lr]::
26156::$$$message_0187_0115_0002$$$::I don't know how many others there were, but it's clear a massacre took place here.[wm canskip=0]::
26157::$$$message_0187_0116_0000$$$::"Sorry. I finished before you got here."[lr]::
26158::$$$message_0187_0116_0001$$$::The Servant speaks, standing idly in the middle of the carnage.[lr]::
26159::$$$message_0187_0116_0002$$$::"..."[wt canskip=0][current withback=false][lr]::
26160::$$$message_0187_0116_0003$$$::He's holding a pair of wicked-looking daggers.[lr]::
26161::$$$message_0187_0116_0004$$$::They're shaped like bestial claws and fangs. He's holding them in a backwards grip. I've never seen weapons that look so difficult to use.[lr]::
26162::$$$message_0187_0116_0005$$$::Are those his weapons[line len=2]Noble Phantasms that symbolize him as a Heroic Spirit?[wm canskip=0][wdash canskip=0]::
26163::$$$message_0187_0117_0000$$$::"Stop glaring like that, Master. You're scaring me.[lr]::
26164::$$$message_0187_0117_0001$$$::Want me to explain the situation?"[lr]::
26165::$$$message_0187_0117_0002$$$::"No need. The wounds match your weapons."[lr]::
26166::$$$message_0187_0117_0003$$$::The shadow nods in eager agreement.[lr]::
26167::$$$message_0187_0117_0004$$$::I don't need to examine this closely.[lr]::
26168::$$$message_0187_0117_0005$$$::The situation points to this Servant as the cause of this grisly scene.::
26169::$$$message_0187_0118_0000$$$::"I just have one question. Why did you kill them?"[lr]::
26170::$$$message_0187_0118_0001$$$::"Why? For you, of course. I was just looking for your enemies. Checking each person one by one is the same as killing them one by one.[lr]::
26171::$$$message_0187_0118_0002$$$::We just need to avoid leaving witnesses, right? This way, we're bound to run into a Master eventually."::
26172::$$$message_0187_0119_0000$$$::"You..."[lr]::
26173::$$$message_0187_0119_0001$$$::He didn't hear a word I said.[lr]::
26174::$$$message_0187_0119_0002$$$::I'm prepared for some casualties in war.[lr]::
26175::$$$message_0187_0119_0003$$$::I'm a mage, which isn't so different from being a killer.[lr]::
26176::$$$message_0187_0119_0004$$$::But still... I never wished for senseless, unproductive deaths like this.::
26177::$$$message_0187_0120_0000$$$::"Do you enjoy killing people?"[lr]::
26178::$$$message_0187_0120_0001$$$::"Huh? Don't be stupid, I don't do this because I like it. I'm just doing what I can to accomplish what was asked of me.[lr]::
26179::$$$message_0187_0120_0002$$$::You know, I think you've gotten the wrong idea just because I look like a human. Aren't Servants just tools, at the end of the day?"::
26180::$$$message_0187_0121_0000$$$::"You aren't answering my question.[lr]::
26181::$$$message_0187_0121_0001$$$::I asked if you enjoy killing people."[lr]::
26182::$$$message_0187_0121_0002$$$::I glare at the Servant.[lr]::
26183::$$$message_0187_0121_0003$$$::The shadow holding the daggers responds,[wm canskip=0][lr]::
26184::$$$message_0187_0121_0004$$$::"Not particularly. There's a lot I can't enjoy if someone's dead."[lr]::
26185::$$$message_0187_0121_0005$$$::He snickers.[lr]::
26186::$$$message_0187_0121_0006$$$::He turns his vulgar grin on me, as if inviting me to join in the fun.[wdash canskip=0]::
26187::$$$message_0187_0122_0000$$$::"...And you call yourself a Heroic Spirit?"[lr]::
26188::$$$message_0187_0122_0001$$$::I can't hide how I feel.[lr]::
26189::$$$message_0187_0122_0002$$$::...How strange. I've seen people like him before, but I feel an unexplained revulsion at this man's way of life.[lr]::
26190::$$$message_0187_0122_0003$$$::Some part of me refuses to tolerate him.[wt canskip=0]::
26191::$$$message_0187_0123_0000$$$::"What about you? What kind of Master isn't okay with killing people? You're spoiling the mood, honestly.[lr]::
26192::$$$message_0187_0123_0001$$$::...Man, what a drag. You totally ruined the show. I was hoping you'd be happy."[wm canskip=0][lr]::
26193::$$$message_0187_0123_0002$$$::"Really? Sorry to disappoint, but I'll never live up to your hopes. I'm convinced now that we'll never see eye to eye. You're the kind of person I hate the most."[current withback=false]::
26194::$$$message_0187_0124_0000$$$::I speak to my Servant with naked hostility.[lr]::
26195::$$$message_0187_0124_0001$$$::All I feel is frustration and hatred at this person whose trust I need to gain.[lr]::
26196::$$$message_0187_0124_0002$$$::...It's driving me mad.[lr]::
26197::$$$message_0187_0124_0003$$$::I thought I'd long since grown out of baring my feelings and showing someone how much I hate them.::
26198::$$$message_0187_0125_0000$$$::"...Huh. Nice. I basically don't like anything.[lr]::
26199::$$$message_0187_0125_0001$$$::It pisses me off when people casually try to befriend me, so this works out for me. You could even say we get along now."[lr]::
26200::$$$message_0187_0125_0002$$$::The Servant doesn't seem concerned.[lr]::
26201::$$$message_0187_0125_0003$$$::I despise him, while he doesn't think anything of me.[lr]::
26202::$$$message_0187_0125_0004$$$::Neither of us has any affection for the other. He seems to be saying that mutual dislike won't cause any particular discord.::
26203::$$$message_0187_0126_0000$$$::"Still, I gotta say, you're the kind that I like."[lr]::
26204::$$$message_0187_0126_0001$$$::He adds...[lr]::
26205::$$$message_0187_0126_0002$$$::That's bizarre.::
26206::$$$message_0187_0127_0000$$$::"...Why? I thought you said you dislike everything.[lr]::
26207::$$$message_0187_0127_0001$$$::As a Master, I've understood what kind of Servant you are. You don't strike me as the type of person who likes anyone."[lr]::
26208::$$$message_0187_0127_0002$$$::"I mean you're a fine woman. I don't like you, but I've got a soft spot for you."::
26209::$$$message_0187_0128_0000$$$::"...Because I'm a woman?"[lr]::
26210::$$$message_0187_0128_0001$$$::"Not just any woman, a [font italic=true]fine[font italic=false] woman. You're smokin' hot.[lr]::
26211::$$$message_0187_0128_0002$$$::I like your figure, but the way you act like a little honor student trying to stick to mainstream opinion, it's so pathetic I can't stand to watch it.[lr]::
26212::$$$message_0187_0128_0003$$$::Get it? You turn me on so much that I want to kill you for some reason, and not because it's the only way I know how to do my job."::
26213::$$$message_0187_0129_0000$$$::The shadow laughs.[lr]::
26214::$$$message_0187_0129_0001$$$::I feel the directionality of his incarnation through our magical connection.::
26215::$$$message_0187_0130_0000$$$::   There's no untruth in his words.[lr]::
26216::$$$message_0187_0130_0001$$$::He really does hate everything.[lr]::
26217::$$$message_0187_0130_0002$$$::He naturally sees everything as something to be killed, even if he has nothing to gain from it.[lr]::
26218::$$$message_0187_0130_0003$$$::...That's the only possible interpretation.[lr]::
26219::$$$message_0187_0130_0004$$$::He's an embodiment of hatred that gains form as a curse just by being there, without using the incendiary device we call magecraft.::
26220::$$$message_0187_0131_0000$$$::...However, that begs the question: [lr]::
26221::$$$message_0187_0131_0001$$$::Why hasn't he tried to kill me, if he's this bloodthirsty?[wt canskip=0][stopdash][current withback=false]::
26222::$$$message_0187_0132_0000$$$::"...Returning to the earlier topic...[lr]::
26223::$$$message_0187_0132_0001$$$::You first said you would kill me, but held back from doing so.[lr]::
26224::$$$message_0187_0132_0002$$$::Now you say you feel lust for me, so why haven't you acted on it? I haven't used a Command Spell on you."::
26225::$$$message_0187_0133_0000$$$::"Hm? Oh, because you're my Master. I made up a rule earlier that says you aren't human.[lr]::
26226::$$$message_0187_0133_0001$$$::Basically, you're the only creature in the world I don't feel like killing.[lr]::
26227::$$$message_0187_0133_0002$$$::You look like a woman, but you aren't human on the inside. I've classified you as a creature that's off-limits to me."[lr]::
26228::$$$message_0187_0133_0003$$$::He doesn't hesitate.[lr]::
26229::$$$message_0187_0133_0004$$$::Even if it's something that's obviously insulting to me.::
26230::$$$message_0187_0134_0000$$$::"You don't see me as human...?"[lr]::
26231::$$$message_0187_0134_0001$$$::I'm used to hearing people say that I'm uninteresting or unattractive, but this is the first time someone's said they don't even see me as a woman.[lr]::
26232::$$$message_0187_0134_0002$$$::Wait, no. He said that he doesn't think of me as human, but I interpreted it that way.::
26233::$$$message_0187_0135_0000$$$::"Oh, don't believe me? I've made the biggest concession I can. You're my first and last exception, you know.[lr]::
26234::$$$message_0187_0135_0001$$$::...Damn it, this is annoying. I was being serious.[lr]::
26235::$$$message_0187_0135_0002$$$::Fine, fine. Need it in writing, do you? [wvl][clfg textoff=0 pos=all rule=シャッター左から time=400]Will you believe me if I do this?"::
26236::$$$message_0187_0136_0000$$$::Did he take my silence as suspicion?[lr]::
26237::$$$message_0187_0136_0001$$$::The Servant tears a page from a notepad on a bloody desk, and starts writing something on it.[sestop time=1000 nowait=true]::
26238::$$$message_0187_0137_0000$$$::"Here, you can have this. Don't give it to anyone else."[lr]::
26239::$$$message_0187_0137_0001$$$::In Japanese, the note reads, "MURDER EXEMPTION CERTIFICATE. VALID UNTIL END OF HOLY GRAIL WAR."::
26240::$$$message_0187_0138_0000$$$::"...What is this?"[lr]::
26241::$$$message_0187_0138_0001$$$::"It's a certificate that says you aren't human.[lr]::
26242::$$$message_0187_0138_0002$$$::Anyone you show it to will know that you're off-limits to me."[lr]::
26243::$$$message_0187_0138_0003$$$::He pushes the scrap of paper into my hands, saying "isn't that nice?"[lr]::
26244::$$$message_0187_0138_0004$$$::...My earlier conclusion was correct after all.[lr]::
26245::$$$message_0187_0138_0005$$$::This Servant and I are hopelessly incompatible.::
26246::$$$message_0187_0139_0000$$$::We can't stay at a murder scene forever.[lr]::
26247::$$$message_0187_0139_0001$$$::We quickly leave the house.[lr]::
26248::$$$message_0187_0139_0002$$$::I'm unhappy with my Servant's unilateral action, but what's done can't be undone. I'm doubtful there's anything to be gained by arguing.::
26249::$$$message_0187_0140_0000$$$::...However, I do feel a strange emotion.[lr]::
26250::$$$message_0187_0140_0001$$$::I can't trust this Servant.[lr]::
26251::$$$message_0187_0140_0002$$$::Master and Servant are connected. That's how I can sense his Alignment[line len=2]his tendency to approve of murder and mercilessly slaughter his enemies, no matter who they might be.::
26252::$$$message_0187_0141_0000$$$::I'm the complete opposite.[lr]::
26253::$$$message_0187_0141_0001$$$::I accomplish my missions without letting personal sentiment get in the way. [lr]::
26254::$$$message_0187_0141_0002$$$::But this Servant [font italic=true]only[font italic=false] uses personal sentiment to carry out his tasks.[lr]::
26255::$$$message_0187_0141_0003$$$::He acts on the personal sentiment of a desire to kill.[lr]::
26256::$$$message_0187_0141_0004$$$::And yet[line len=2]::
26257::$$$message_0187_0142_0000$$$::"We're not going anywhere else, Master?[lr]::
26258::$$$message_0187_0142_0001$$$::Oh, are we going to lay in ambush for any idiot Masters who come to check this out?"[lr]::
26259::$$$message_0187_0142_0002$$$::"No mage would fall for such an obvious trap, and I don't intend to commence battle until the second stage of the plan.[lr]::
26260::$$$message_0187_0142_0003$$$::I told you, we're only gathering intelligence right now."::
26261::$$$message_0187_0143_0000$$$::"Nah, I'm pretty sure some dumb rookie would fall for it.[lr]::
26262::$$$message_0187_0143_0001$$$::Like a guy who works hard to patrol every night and is liable to get himself killed doing it![lr]::
26263::$$$message_0187_0143_0002$$$::He doesn't realize that he's opening himself up to getting eaten by the bigger fish. Do-gooders just never learn."[lr]::
26264::$$$message_0187_0143_0003$$$::"..."[lr]::
26265::$$$message_0187_0143_0004$$$::I ignore my Servant's flippant remarks and start walking.::
26266::$$$message_0187_0144_0000$$$::...And yet...[lr]::
26267::$$$message_0187_0144_0001$$$::...despite all the negatives, he doesn't feel unpleasant to me.[lr]::
26268::$$$message_0187_0144_0002$$$::He's the type of person I dislike the most. I disapprove of every aspect of him.[lr]::
26269::$$$message_0187_0144_0003$$$::Then why can't I bring myself to fully hate him?::
26270::$$$message_0187_0145_0000$$$::I close my eyes and feel our connection.[lr]::
26271::$$$message_0187_0145_0001$$$::Occasionally, something cool and refreshing accompanies the magical energy.::
26272::$$$message_0187_0146_0000$$$::A prayer that gnaws at my chest, like homesickness or yearning.[lr]::
26273::$$$message_0187_0146_0001$$$::It's so...hollow.[lr]::
26274::$$$message_0187_0146_0002$$$::The emptiness speaks to me.[lr]::
26275::$$$message_0187_0146_0003$$$::It tells me that this Servant will never betray me, though I don't exactly know why.[lr]::
26276::$$$message_0187_0146_0004$$$::It tells me that he'll lend me his chaotic will to make my wish come true.::
26277::$$$message_0187_0147_0000$$$::We resume our patrol.[lr]::
26278::$$$message_0187_0147_0001$$$::Tonight, we're going to scout out the key locations in Shinto.::
26279::$$$message_0187_0148_0000$$$::We finish reconnoitering Shinto after about two hours.[lr]::
26280::$$$message_0187_0148_0001$$$::There are no signs of any mage activity.[lr]::
26281::$$$message_0187_0148_0002$$$::Furthermore, I verified my Servant's claims of a "mysterious bunch."[lr]::
26282::$$$message_0187_0148_0003$$$::I still don't quite believe it, but Fuyuki is indeed changing.[lr]::
26283::$$$message_0187_0148_0004$$$::Here and there, I feel strange presences.[lr]::
26284::$$$message_0187_0148_0005$$$::Someone is always watching me.[lr]::
26285::$$$message_0187_0148_0006$$$::   There are odd tears all over town.::
26286::$$$message_0187_0149_0000$$$::Despite all the traces of magical energy, there are no signs of magecraft at all.[lr]::
26287::$$$message_0187_0149_0001$$$::It doesn't seem to be a Master amassing magical energy, either.[lr]::
26288::$$$message_0187_0149_0002$$$::There are things eating the civilians, but they don't seem to have anything to do with the war.[lr]::
26289::$$$message_0187_0149_0003$$$::No Master would have anything to gain from doing this.[lr]::
26290::$$$message_0187_0149_0004$$$::It would only serve to interrupt the Holy Grail War.::
26291::$$$message_0187_0150_0000$$$::"I see. But if it's a foreign mage here to learn about the Holy Grail War..."[lr]::
26292::$$$message_0187_0150_0001$$$::There could be mages present who covet the Holy Grail but weren't chosen as Masters.[lr]::
26293::$$$message_0187_0150_0002$$$::Someone like that could attempt to obstruct the ritual out of spite...or they could be acting under orders from a foreign organization to hinder the Holy Grail War itself.[lr]::
26294::$$$message_0187_0150_0003$$$::Regardless, I'm becoming more certain that there's an eighth mage operating in Fuyuki.::
26295::$$$message_0187_0151_0000$$$::"An eighth? Someone else trying to get in our way?"[lr]::
26296::$$$message_0187_0151_0001$$$::"...I can't say for sure, but it's highly likely.[lr]::
26297::$$$message_0187_0151_0002$$$::I'm confident there's a mage I don't know who's trying to interfere with the Holy Grail War.[lr]::
26298::$$$message_0187_0151_0003$$$::I don't know their goal, but..."[lr]::
26299::$$$message_0187_0151_0004$$$::They would begin by breaking the rules of the Holy Grail War.[lr]::
26300::$$$message_0187_0151_0005$$$::It might be best to think of them as an enemy to all of the Masters, not just me.::
26301::$$$message_0187_0152_0000$$$::"Huh. What's this mystery mage like?"[lr]::
26302::$$$message_0187_0152_0001$$$::"They lack the confidence to engage in direct combat, but are skilled at creating wide-area Bounded Fields. Defense suits them better than offense.[lr]::
26303::$$$message_0187_0152_0002$$$::They aren't versed in orthodox magecraft...but I see signs of black magecraft and druidic thinking in their work."[lr]::
26304::$$$message_0187_0152_0003$$$::"Not that. I'm asking if they're strong or weak."[lr]::
26305::$$$message_0187_0152_0004$$$::"Their skills as a mage are elementary, but..."::
26306::$$$message_0187_0153_0000$$$::The magical energy they leave behind has a very dense aroma.[lr]::
26307::$$$message_0187_0153_0001$$$::Magical energy is only the fuel that activates magecraft. It doesn't have any effect on its own.[lr]::
26308::$$$message_0187_0153_0002$$$::But in some special cases where the magical energy alone exhibits attributes similar to magecraft itself, it leaves behind tangible traces.::
26309::$$$message_0187_0154_0000$$$::To use an example, it's said that the Einzberns endowed the Holy Grail with a human persona.[lr]::
26310::$$$message_0187_0154_0001$$$::If this persona has magical energy, then it would exhibit the magical attribute of granting wishes from the moment of its creation.[lr]::
26311::$$$message_0187_0154_0002$$$::Its life functions are directly linked to its function as the Holy Grail, so the magical energy it generates can take on miraculous forms that resemble "magecraft."::
26312::$$$message_0187_0155_0000$$$::Incarnated demons as defined by the Holy Church are also examples of this.[lr]::
26313::$$$message_0187_0155_0001$$$::These entities are constructed as demons first and foremost, so they can use magecraft at a higher level than humans.::
26314::$$$message_0187_0156_0000$$$::Our Magic Circuits are just imitation nerves. They're abilities tacked on behind our biological nerves.[lr]::
26315::$$$message_0187_0156_0001$$$::But demons don't need those pseudo-nerves.[lr]::
26316::$$$message_0187_0156_0002$$$::Their entire function as organisms is to attract demonic factors.[lr]::
26317::$$$message_0187_0156_0003$$$::Apparently, the Church calls them True Demons.[lr]::
26318::$$$message_0187_0156_0004$$$::They're different from the fakes that wear human thoughts and gain individual names. They're demons in the truest sense, sent by the Lord before humans named them.::
26319::$$$message_0187_0157_0000$$$::"...In any case, they're trouble.[lr]::
26320::$$$message_0187_0157_0001$$$::If it's a mage driven by mundane motives, they're not much of a concern, but if it's a freelancer in the Church's employ, we shouldn't underestimate them.[lr]::
26321::$$$message_0187_0157_0002$$$::...Come to think of it, the person who won the last Holy Grail War was..."::
26322::$$$message_0187_0158_0000$$$::A freelance mage employed by the Einzberns.[lr]::
26323::$$$message_0187_0158_0001$$$::His name was Kiritsugu Emiya.[lr]::
26324::$$$message_0187_0158_0002$$$::He was a combat-oriented mage who withdrew from the frontlines after receiving a Seal Designation, and was invited by the Einzberns.[lr]::
26325::$$$message_0187_0158_0003$$$::Kiritsugu Emiya's activities would have overlapped with my profession. If he were still active today, I'm sure we would have clashed.::
26326::$$$message_0187_0159_0000$$$::The situation is starting to spiral out of control, but I can't change my overall approach just because there's one more enemy.[lr]::
26327::$$$message_0187_0159_0001$$$::I'll continue gathering intelligence while avoiding civilian harm where possible, and learn about all of the Masters.[lr]::
26328::$$$message_0187_0159_0002$$$::The problem is what comes after that.[lr]::
26329::$$$message_0187_0159_0003$$$::My Servant's abilities are clearly of a low rank.[lr]::
26330::$$$message_0187_0159_0004$$$::In a stand-up fight, it's inevitable that he'll exhaust his powers and fall.::
26331::$$$message_0187_0160_0000$$$::I need to think about the order in which we'll fight the Masters, but our final opponent is clear.[lr]::
26332::$$$message_0187_0160_0001$$$::Einzbern, the Holy Grail's lineage.[lr]::
26333::$$$message_0187_0160_0002$$$::It's said that they prepared the most powerful Master.[lr]::
26334::$$$message_0187_0160_0003$$$::I've fought an Einzbern homunculus before.[lr]::
26335::$$$message_0187_0160_0004$$$::...It was a defective, scrapped model that managed to escape from Einzbern territory and was hiding in the filthiest parts of a human town.::
26336::$$$message_0187_0161_0000$$$::I was ordered to dispose of it, but the mission wasn't easy.[lr]::
26337::$$$message_0187_0161_0001$$$::Even accounting for my relative inexperience at the time, the Einzbern homunculus was stronger than the average mage.::
26338::$$$message_0187_0162_0000$$$::And now, those same Einzberns have sent a Master they claim to be the strongest.[lr]::
26339::$$$message_0187_0162_0001$$$::Frankly, it's impossible to calculate my chances of victory at this stage.[lr]::
26340::$$$message_0187_0162_0002$$$::Fighting the Einzbern Master before knowing what cards she has would be suicidal.::
26341::$$$message_0187_0163_0000$$$::The Einzberns keep a castle in the forest on the outskirts of town.[lr]::
26342::$$$message_0187_0163_0001$$$::...Once I attempt to assault that fortress, it'll be the final showdown of my Holy Grail War.[current withback=false]::
26343::$$$message_0187_0164_0000$$$::Lastly, we arrive at the foreigners' cemetery on top of a hill.[lr]::
26344::$$$message_0187_0164_0001$$$::Maybe the shadow of the Einzberns still lingers in my mind.[lr]::
26345::$$$message_0187_0164_0002$$$::I feel slightly dizzy and weak at the knees.[lr]::
26346::$$$message_0187_0164_0003$$$::...I don't want to get too close to this place.[wm canskip=0]::
26347::$$$message_0187_0165_0000$$$::"What's wrong, Master? Something on your mind?"[lr]::
26348::$$$message_0187_0165_0001$$$::Did the unease show on my face?[lr]::
26349::$$$message_0187_0165_0002$$$::My Servant seems rather worried about my condition.::
26350::$$$message_0187_0166_0000$$$::I'm thrown off by his sudden show of concern.[lr]::
26351::$$$message_0187_0166_0001$$$::"...This might be a silly question,[lr]::
26352::$$$message_0187_0166_0002$$$::but do you think I can win...?"[lr]::
26353::$$$message_0187_0166_0003$$$::I voice a timid insecurity without thinking.::
26354::$$$message_0187_0167_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
26355::$$$message_0187_0167_0001$$$::My Servant's color changes.[lr]::
26356::$$$message_0187_0167_0002$$$::He turns away from me, his lips still curled into a sardonic smile.::
26357::$$$message_0187_0168_0000$$$::"It's still too soon to worry about that.[lr]::
26358::$$$message_0187_0168_0001$$$::You can judge whether you'll win or lose after you decide what you're going to defeat."[lr]::
26359::$$$message_0187_0168_0002$$$::His voice is strained.[lr]::
26360::$$$message_0187_0168_0003$$$::His posture, hunched forward like a beast in front of its prey.::
26361::$$$message_0187_0169_0000$$$::"...Lucky us.[lr]::
26362::$$$message_0187_0169_0001$$$::Looks like we don't have time to worry about this."[lr]::
26363::$$$message_0187_0169_0002$$$::He grins.[lr]::
26364::$$$message_0187_0169_0003$$$::I follow his gaze and see a Master and Servant.::
26365::$$$message_0187_0170_0000$$$::"Ngh...!"[lr]::
26366::$$$message_0187_0170_0001$$$::I sense powerful magical energy.[lr]::
26367::$$$message_0187_0170_0002$$$::The glint of a Command Spell on her left hand.[lr]::
26368::$$$message_0187_0170_0003$$$::She looks young, but she's likely far more talented than me.::
26369::$$$message_0187_0171_0000$$$::"A pleasure to meet you, rustic backwater mage.[lr]::
26370::$$$message_0187_0171_0001$$$::Do we need a formal exchange of names?"[lr]::
26371::$$$message_0187_0171_0002$$$::Her scornful gaze looks practiced. She must be from some noble house.::
26372::$$$message_0187_0172_0000$$$::There's a humanoid figure next to the girl.[lr]::
26373::$$$message_0187_0172_0001$$$::I can't tell what class it is, but it must be a Servant if it's with a Master.::
26374::$$$message_0187_0173_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
26375::$$$message_0187_0173_0001$$$::I retrieve a pair of gloves, inscribed with runes of divine protection, from my breast pocket.[lr]::
26376::$$$message_0187_0173_0002$$$::They snag on something hard and pull that out, too.[lr]::
26377::$$$message_0187_0173_0003$$$::Why do I have this earring? Why did I put it away so carefully?[lr]::
26378::$$$message_0187_0173_0004$$$::Questions come to mind, but this isn't the time for them.::
26379::$$$message_0187_0174_0000$$$::I put the gloves on.[lr]::
26380::$$$message_0187_0174_0001$$$::The girl politely waits for me to finish.[lr]::
26381::$$$message_0187_0174_0002$$$::...I regret leaving my pack at the house. I'll bring it from now on, even if I only intend to go scouting.[lr]::
26382::$$$message_0187_0174_0003$$$::Even though I shouldn't use my secret weapon too early, it's better to have it and not need it.::
26383::$$$message_0187_0175_0000$$$::"I'm going to gauge the enemy's strength. You take the Servant."[wm canskip=0][lr]::
26384::$$$message_0187_0175_0001$$$::"Sure thing."[lr]::
26385::$$$message_0187_0175_0002$$$::He runs at the girl's Servant without bothering to wait and watch.[wm canskip=0]::
26386::$$$message_0187_0176_0000$$$::Two shadows clash.[lr]::
26387::$$$message_0187_0176_0001$$$::I slip by them, rushing the defenseless Master.::
26388::$$$message_0187_0177_0000$$$::"Ha! You really are a country bumpkin without a name to give! [cacheimage storage=14風圧][wvl][se storage=se120.wav][movefg textoff=0 opacity=170 left=0 top=0 time=1000 accel=0 storage=14風圧]Very well, consider yourself honored for falling into the hands of an Edelfelt!"[wdash canskip=0][lr]::
26389::$$$message_0187_0177_0001$$$::The Gandr Shot she fires feels as if it came from a gun.[lr]::
26390::$$$message_0187_0177_0002$$$::It's a single-action spell that doesn't let me close in.[lr]::
26391::$$$message_0187_0177_0003$$$::The girl is literally a magical cannon. It's not a metaphor.::
26392::$$$message_0187_0178_0000$$$::   Edelfelt.[lr]::
26393::$$$message_0187_0178_0001$$$::The famous Finnish family, the Jewel-Weighing Scales, who are known for producing Gandr users. Those Edelfelts...![lr]::
26394::$$$message_0187_0178_0002$$$::I've heard that the young head of the current generation is the pride of her clan. After seeing her skills, I can believe it!::
26395::$$$message_0187_0179_0000$$$::I can't defend against the curses striking my thighs.[lr]::
26396::$$$message_0187_0179_0001$$$::Without stopping, I use my left fist to parry the shots aimed at my upper body.[lr]::
26397::$$$message_0187_0179_0002$$$::"Y-you're blocking my Gandr bare-handed!?"[lr]::
26398::$$$message_0187_0179_0003$$$::I step in.[lr]::
26399::$$$message_0187_0179_0004$$$::My right fist, lowered to my chest level, shoots into the girl's flank for a liver shot.::
26400::$$$message_0187_0180_0000$$$::"Guh...!?"[lr]::
26401::$$$message_0187_0180_0001$$$::I'm sent flying.[lr]::
26402::$$$message_0187_0180_0002$$$::Something appeared behind her and threw me back as soon as it blocked my body blow.::
26403::$$$message_0187_0181_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
26404::$$$message_0187_0181_0001$$$::A swordsman stands between us.[lr]::
26405::$$$message_0187_0181_0002$$$::   A Servant.[lr]::
26406::$$$message_0187_0181_0003$$$::That's a Servant, without a doubt.[lr]::
26407::$$$message_0187_0181_0004$$$::"What? Then who's the other girl..."[lr]::
26408::$$$message_0187_0181_0005$$$::As soon as I turn to look, the match is decided.[stopmove][stopdash][wt canskip=0][current withback=false]::
26409::$$$message_0187_0182_0000$$$::"Please, Saber...!"[lr]::
26410::$$$message_0187_0182_0001$$$::Another girl shouts.[lr]::
26411::$$$message_0187_0182_0002$$$::At the second girl's command, Saber defeats my Servant.[lr]::
26412::$$$message_0187_0182_0003$$$::...He's shockingly weak.[lr]::
26413::$$$message_0187_0182_0004$$$::In a flash of light, without even managing to get his daggers up, my Servant's head goes flying, and he vanishes.[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0]::
26414::$$$message_0187_0183_0000$$$::"Well, that was disappointing. Way to spoil the fun.[lr]::
26415::$$$message_0187_0183_0001$$$::Clean this up, Saber. Let's go home and enjoy a hot cup of coffee."[lr]::
26416::$$$message_0187_0183_0002$$$::The Saber Servant nods wordlessly.[wt canskip=0][current withback=false]::
26417::$$$message_0187_0184_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
26418::$$$message_0187_0184_0001$$$::Unable to fend off the bladed assault, I go down.[lr]::
26419::$$$message_0187_0184_0002$$$::This is the Servant known as Saber.[lr]::
26420::$$$message_0187_0184_0003$$$::But what happened?[wm canskip=0][lr]::
26421::$$$message_0187_0184_0004$$$::Each of the girls commanded a different Saber.::
26422::$$$message_0187_0185_0000$$$::"You didn't do your homework.[lr]::
26423::$$$message_0187_0185_0001$$$::Haven't you ever heard that the Edelfelts are always led by sisters?"[lr]::
26424::$$$message_0187_0185_0002$$$::Sisters[line len=2]so that's their bloodline's magical attribute.[lr]::
26425::$$$message_0187_0185_0003$$$::Mage society normally abhors the presence of two heirs, but the Scales are famous for this.[lr]::
26426::$$$message_0187_0185_0004$$$::Meaning...that both of them count as a single Master. Each sister summoned and commands a different aspect of the same Heroic Spirit...![wt canskip=0]::
26427::$$$message_0187_0186_0000$$$::"One down. Know the glory of falling by our hands, as well as the shame of being the first to fall.[lr]::
26428::$$$message_0187_0186_0001$$$::That leaves five more Masters."[wt canskip=0][lr]::
26429::$$$message_0187_0186_0002$$$::The girl's voice resonates with the moon.[lr]::
26430::$$$message_0187_0186_0003$$$::Saber doesn't spare any emotion for me,[lr]::
26431::$$$message_0187_0186_0004$$$::and silently plunges a sword into my chest.[wdash canskip=0][wdash canskip=0][current withback=false]::
26432::$$$message_0187_0187_0000$$$::                             I black out.[lr]::
26433::$$$message_0187_0187_0001$$$::                             The moon spins like a bleached skull.::
26434::$$$message_0187_0188_0000$$$::                        Thus unfolds my Holy Grail War. [font color=0x9E0326]Once again...[rf][lr]::
26435::$$$message_0187_0188_0001$$$::                        the curtain falls,[lr]::
26436::$$$message_0187_0188_0002$$$::                        with no end to the story, and no conclusion in sight.[nolr][p]::
926369::$$$message_9187_0171_0000$$$::"A pleasure to meet you, rustic backwater mage."[r]::

